Z||000001||Hartz||12-10-2001||08:28 PM||||Well, it's not mine, but here's what's keeping my father busy these days:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ta_front.JPG"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/ta_side.JPG"> <P>It's a '79 TA.  33K original, one owner miles.  It's pretty much a stripper with the Pontiac 400 - (it's NOT a big block!)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> and 4 speed tranny. (A fairly rare combination for '79.)  Plans call for a "mild" refreshening of the motor   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> , some bolt ons, a suspension rebuild, and a general overall clean up.<P>I told him as soon as he is done, I'll run him against my V8!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Hartz<P>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo<BR>hartzfeld.home.mindspring.com||||reg||14
